---
const practiceAreas = [
  "Heat-transfer-vinyl shirts",
  "Paintings",
  "Molded resin work",
  "D&D dice",
  "Sand-and-shell coasters",
  "Bead bracelets",
];
---

<section class="about-practice" aria-labelledby="practice-heading">
  <div class="practice-intro">
    <p class="section-label">01 / The practice</p>
    <div>
      <h2 id="practice-heading">Different materials. One maker's hand.</h2>
      <p>
        Breezy's Creative Co. moves between wearable pieces, painting, resin,
        and small handmade objects. The range is part of the practice; it is not
        a promise that every piece is continuously for sale or available as a
        commission.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ol class="practice-list">
    {
      practiceAreas.map((area, index) => (
        <li>
          <span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
          <p>{area}</p>
        </li>
      ))
    }
  </ol>

  <div class="workspace-note">
    <p class="section-label">02 / Where ideas take shape</p>
    <div>
      <h2>A home-based, hands-on workspace.</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on the piece, making may involve a Cricut Explore 3, heat
        press and vinyl, or an easel, paints, and a projector used for outlines
        and references. Resin molds and general art supplies support the other
        parts of the practice.
      </p>
      <p>
        Paid custom shirt work has already grown through community connections
        and word of mouth. This website brings the work together as a portfolio,
        a place to begin custom-work conversations, and eventually a storefront.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-practice {
    padding: clamp(6rem, 10vw, 11rem)
      max(1.5rem, calc((100% - var(--page-width)) / 2));
    background: var(--color-cream);
  }

  .practice-intro,
  .workspace-note {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(10rem, 0.35fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 10rem);
  }

  .section-label {
    margin: 0.4rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    font-size: 0.67rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h2 {
    max-width: 60rem;
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.6vw, 6.25rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.05em;
    line-height: 0.98;
  }

  .practice-intro div > p,
  .workspace-note div > p {
    max-width: 47rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .practice-list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    margin: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9rem) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    list-style: none;
  }

  .practice-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: baseline;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 5rem)
      clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .practice-list li:nth-child(even) {
    padding-right: 0;
    padding-left: clamp(1.5rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .practice-list span {
    color: var(--color-taupe);
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
  }

  .practice-list p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 3vw, 3.25rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .workspace-note {
    margin-top: clamp(6rem, 11vw, 12rem);
    padding-top: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-gold);
  }

  .workspace-note h2 {
    max-width: 53rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .practice-intro,
    .workspace-note {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.75rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 42rem) {
    .about-practice {
      padding-inline: 1rem;
    }

    .practice-list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .practice-list li,
    .practice-list li:nth-child(even) {
      padding: 1.75rem 0;
      border-left: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
